 "content": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-dark\" style=\"margin-top:0px;padding-right:24px;padding-left:24px;min-height:460px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim has-background-gradient\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(14,17,22,0.92) 0%,rgba(14,17,22,0.65) 55%,rgba(14,17,22,0.2) 100%)\"></span><img data-attachment-id=\"83\" data-permalink=\"/mangrove-river-maze-sundarbans/\" data-orig-file=\"/media/2026/11/page-for-ngos-community-meeting.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1920,1280\" data-comments-opened=\"0\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;default&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;default&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Mangrove River Maze, Sundarbans\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"&lt;p&gt;Photo: Amdadphoto / Wikimedia Commons, &lt;a href=&quot;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0&quot;&gt;CC BY-SA 4.0&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href=&quot;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mangrove_River_Maze.jpg&quot;&gt;Source&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n\" data-large-file=\"/media/2026/11/page-for-ngos-community-meeting.jpg\" data-cover-min-height=\"460\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-83\" alt=\"AI-generated illustration: a village community meeting under large trees\" src=\"/media/2026/11/page-for-ngos-community-meeting.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" /><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-cover-is-layout-fa78d99b wp-block-cover-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-f1913008 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#12b886;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5\"><strong>FOR NGOs, INGOs, UN AGENCIES AND RESEARCHERS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(29.768px, 1.861rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 2.18), 52px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Share your work with Bangladesh&#8217;s development sector</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#e3ebf2;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.588), 20px);line-height:1.5\">Send us your news, research, vacancies and funding calls. We review every submission and publish what matters to the sector. Free, always.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/submit/\" style=\"border-radius:999px;color:#0e1116;background-color:#12b886;padding-top:14px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:28px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.294), 17px);font-weight:700\">Submit content</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6d1d3d26 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:56px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:56px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(22.041px, 1.378rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.369), 36px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">What you can send</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.294), 17px);line-height:1.5\">Six kinds of content, each with its own place on Devlens.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-0d0a1907 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e7e7e1;border-width:1px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:26px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:26px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#b3261e;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>NEWS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Programme news and announcements</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Launches, partnerships, results and leadership changes with sector relevance.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e7e7e1;border-width:1px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:26px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:26px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0b6e8a;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>RESEARCH</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Reports, evaluations and studies</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">We summarise the findings and link to your original document.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e7e7e1;border-width:1px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:26px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:26px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#1b7a3e;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>FUNDING</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Calls for proposals and tenders</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Grants, EOIs, RFPs and consultancies, listed with deadline and status.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-0d0a1907 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e7e7e1;border-width:1px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:26px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:26px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#9a5400;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>JOBS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Vacancies and internships</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Free listings with a link to your official advert.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e7e7e1;border-width:1px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:26px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:26px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#5b3a8c;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>EVENTS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Conferences and trainings</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Workshops, webinars and courses open to the sector.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-border-color has-background is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"border-color:#e7e7e1;border-width:1px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:26px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:26px;padding-left:24px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#0e1116;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>IDEAS</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Opinion and analysis</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Pitch an argued piece of 800 to 1,200 words from your experts.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6d1d3d26 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:56px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:56px;padding-left:24px\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(22.041px, 1.378rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.369), 36px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">How it works</h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-55e5096b wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#12b886;font-size:clamp(25.984px, 1.624rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.766), 44px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>01</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Send it</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#a6abb3;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Use the form below. Add a link to the original document or notice.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#12b886;font-size:clamp(25.984px, 1.624rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.766), 44px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>02</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">We check it</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#a6abb3;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Editors verify names, figures, dates and deadlines with the source.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#12b886;font-size:clamp(25.984px, 1.624rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.766), 44px);line-height:1.5\"><strong>03</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(14.642px, 0.915rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.721), 22px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">We publish</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#a6abb3;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.098), 15px);line-height:1.5\">Relevant content goes live once it is verified. We will contact you if we need more information.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6d1d3d26 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#f4f4ef;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:56px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:56px;padding-left:24px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e29ce5ca wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#0e1116;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px;font-size:clamp(18.959px, 1.185rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.082), 30px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Our promise to contributors</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#6b6f76;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.294), 17px);line-height:1.5\">Submitting is always free and coverage cannot be bought. We edit for accuracy and clarity, remove promotional language and explain why it matters to the wider sector. We may ask you questions before publishing, and we may decline content that is routine, promotional or cannot be verified.</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<ul style=\"font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.294), 17px);line-height:1.9\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>✓ No fees, ever</li>\n\n\n<li>✓ Every listing links to your original source</li>\n\n\n<li>✓ Clear labels for any sponsored content</li>\n\n\n<li>✓ Corrections handled openly</li>\n\n\n<li>✓ Read our <a href=\"/editorial-standards/\">editorial standards</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4b3ac3fb wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#f4f4ef;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;padding-top:8px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:64px;padding-left:24px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-478b7b45 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"border-radius:32px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#0e1116;padding-top:48px;padding-right:40px;padding-bottom:48px;padding-left:40px\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:clamp(24.034px, 1.502rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 1.565), 40px);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.035em;line-height:1.06\">Ready to share your work?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"color:#a6abb3;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.294), 17px);\">It takes about two minutes. Include a link to your original document or notice.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-link-color has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/submit/\" style=\"border-radius:999px;color:#0e1116;background-color:#12b886;padding-top:14px;padding-right:28px;padding-bottom:14px;padding-left:28px;font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.294), 17px);font-weight:700\">Share your work ↗</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n"
}